{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2022-03-09 09:00:00', 'title': 'GARBO LAUNCHES BACKGROUND CHECK PLATFORM TO PUBLIC AND ON TINDER', 'text': "DALLAS\xa0AND NEW YORK, MARCH 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0STARTING TODAY, GARBO'S NEW ONLINE BACKGROUND CHECK PLATFORM WILL BE MADE AVAILABLE TO THE GENERAL PUBLIC IN THE U.S., AND WILL ALSO BE LAUNCHED TO TINDER MEMBERS VIA TINDER'S SAFETY CENTER, MARKING A FIRST-OF-ITS-KIND PARTNERSHIP FOR THE DATING INDUSTRY. MATCH GROUP (NASDAQ: MTCH) PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED A SIGNIFICANT CONTRIBUTION TO GARBO TO HELP THE NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATION ACCELERATE ITS GROWTH AND ADOPTION ACROSS THE TECHNOLOGY INDUSTRY."}